{
  "$comment": "@xxd/css 原生组件注册表：文档站、pnpm xxd ls / doc、xxd-ui Skill 都读它。改组件时同步改这里（registry.test.mjs 会检查类名真的存在于 CSS）。",
  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Text",
      "zh": "文字层级",
      "category": "基础",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-text",
        "xxd-text-pair"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "data-variant": "display | heading1 | heading2 | heading3 | body | secondary | caption | mono | mono-secondary | success | danger | warning",
        "data-size": "xs | sm | base | lg",
        "data-truncate": "一行省略"
      },
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-text-pair\">\n  <h2 class=\"xxd-text\" data-variant=\"heading2\">外观</h2>\n  <p class=\"xxd-text\" data-variant=\"caption\">只影响这个插件</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"xxd-text\">正文 13px <span class=\"xxd-text\" data-variant=\"mono\">--r-sm</span></p>",
      "react": "Text",
      "rules": [
        "字重只有 400 / 500 / 600",
        "相关的字靠得更近",
        "不改字距",
        "行内等宽字 0.92em"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Interaction",
      "zh": "交互工具",
      "category": "基础",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-reveal",
        "xxd-concentric",
        "xxd-icon-line",
        "xxd-num",
        "xxd-bubble"
      ],
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-row\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line)\"><div class=\"xxd-row__text\">悬停这一行</div><button class=\"xxd-btn xxd-reveal\" data-size=\"xs\">编辑</button></div>\n<div class=\"xxd-concentric\" style=\"--pad:4px;border:1px solid var(--line)\"><button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"sm\">同心圆角</button></div>",
      "js": "Xxd.showBubble(button, \"已复制\")",
      "rules": [
        "hover 进入立即变、离开 140ms 淡回",
        "悬停才出现的操作：触屏常显、键盘能到",
        "同心圆角：外 = 内 + 间距"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Button",
      "zh": "按钮",
      "category": "操作",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-btn"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "data-variant": "primary | secondary（缺省）| ghost | outline | danger | danger-outline",
        "data-size": "xs | sm | md | lg",
        "data-icon-only": "纯图标（必须有 aria-label）",
        "aria-pressed": "切换态",
        "aria-busy": "进行中：宽度不跳，转圈居中；Xxd.runBusy(btn, task) 完成后图标变勾",
        "data-block": "撑满一行",
        "data-shape": "round：圆形图标按钮（跟随圆角开关）"
      },
      "markup": "<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"primary\">写入 X</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\">保存草稿</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\">稍后</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"danger\">删除</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"outline\">导出</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"xs\">xs</button>",
      "react": "Button",
      "rules": [
        "按钮文字描述下一次点击会做什么",
        "一处只放一个实心按钮",
        "破坏性操作写清楚，不只靠颜色",
        "§9"
      ],
      "js": "await Xxd.runBusy(button, () => save())",
      "sample": "<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"primary\">写入 X</button>",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "hover",
        "focus",
        "active",
        "disabled",
        "busy"
      ],
      "summary": "按钮文字描述下一次点击会做什么。一处只放一个实心按钮。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "title": "尺寸",
          "markup": "<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"xs\">xs</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"sm\">sm</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\">md</button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"lg\">lg</button>"
        },
        {
          "title": "图标按钮",
          "markup": "<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-icon-only aria-label=\"搜索\" data-tooltip=\"搜索 ⌘F\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Search\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-icon-only data-shape=\"round\" aria-label=\"新建\" data-tooltip=\"新建\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Plus\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-icon-only aria-label=\"更多\" data-tooltip=\"更多\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Ellipsis\"></i></button>",
          "text": "纯图标按钮必须有 aria-label；悬停时 tooltip 连续出现。圆形图标按钮跟随圆角开关。"
        },
        {
          "title": "纯平 / 质感（D1 对比）",
          "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-cluster\" data-finish-preview=\"flat\"><button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"primary\">写入 X</button><button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"danger\">删除</button></div>",
          "text": "右上角「主色」里把按钮质感切到「质感」：实心按钮多一条顶部 1px 内高光、深一点的边，按下时下沉 0.5px。"
        },
        {
          "title": "进行中与完成",
          "markup": "<button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"primary\" onclick=\"Xxd.runBusy(this, () => new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 1200)))\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Save\" data-size=\"16\"></i>保存</button>",
          "text": "点一下：宽度不跳，转圈居中；完成后图标变勾 1 秒。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Link",
      "zh": "文字链接按钮",
      "category": "操作",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-link"
      ],
      "markup": "<button class=\"xxd-link\">改为新建一篇</button>",
      "react": "Link",
      "rules": [
        "40% 下划线，hover 变实"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "data-variant": "inline（缺省）| plain | current",
        "data-external / target=_blank": "后面带外链图标"
      },
      "sample": "<a class=\"xxd-link\" href=\"#\">改为新建一篇</a>",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "hover",
        "focus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ButtonGroup",
      "zh": "按钮组",
      "category": "操作",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-btn-group"
      ],
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-btn-group\"><button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"sm\">左</button><button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-size=\"sm\">右</button></div>",
      "react": "ButtonGroup"
    },
    {
      "name": "Field",
      "zh": "字段",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-field",
        "xxd-label",
        "xxd-help",
        "xxd-error",
        "xxd-input",
        "xxd-textarea"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "aria-invalid": "出错时边框变危险色",
        "data-optional": "在 label 上：后面加「可选」",
        "data-autosize": "textarea 随内容长高"
      },
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-field\">\n  <label class=\"xxd-label\" for=\"title\">标题</label>\n  <input class=\"xxd-input\" id=\"title\" placeholder=\"给这篇文章起个名字\">\n  <p class=\"xxd-help\">最多 100 个字</p>\n</div>",
      "react": "Input",
      "rules": [
        "一个框只有一个框：聚焦时边框变深一次，不加外圈和内框",
        "§4"
      ],
      "sample": "<input class=\"xxd-input\" style=\"width:120px\" placeholder=\"标题\">",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "hover",
        "focus",
        "disabled",
        "error",
        "readonly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Select",
      "zh": "选择",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-select"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "data-variant": "bare：设置行里的「一个值 + 一个 chevron」"
      },
      "markup": "<label class=\"xxd-select\"><select aria-label=\"图片质量\"><option>高</option><option>标准</option></select></label>",
      "react": "Select",
      "rules": [
        "原生 <select>，不重写下拉",
        "设置行里用 bare：值 + chevron，不是盒子"
      ],
      "sample": "<label class=\"xxd-select\"><select aria-label=\"质量\"><option>高</option></select></label>",
      "states": [
        "default",
        "hover",
        "focus",
        "disabled"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Picker",
      "zh": "自绘选择",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-picker",
        "xxd-picker__trigger",
        "xxd-picker__value",
        "xxd-option-group",
        "xxd-option-group__label"
      ],
      "summary": "原生 <select> 做不到的：分组、每项说明、图标、多选。简单场景继续用 Select（原生）。",
      "attributes": {
        "data-multiple": "多选（勾选，列表不关）",
        "data-placeholder": "没选时显示的字",
        "data-size": "sm",
        "aria-invalid": "出错",
        "data-disabled": "禁用"
      },
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-picker\" data-xxd-picker style=\"width:220px\">\n  <button class=\"xxd-picker__trigger\"><span class=\"xxd-picker__value\"></span></button>\n  <div class=\"xxd-listbox\">\n    <div class=\"xxd-option-group\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"画质\">\n      <div class=\"xxd-option-group__label\">画质</div>\n      <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"high\" aria-selected=\"true\"><span>高<small>2K，慢一点</small></span></div>\n      <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"standard\"><span>标准<small>1K，最快</small></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"xxd-option-group\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"其他\">\n      <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"auto\">跟随会员计划</div>\n      <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"x\" aria-disabled=\"true\">4K（即将推出）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"xxd-picker\" data-xxd-picker data-multiple data-placeholder=\"选择标签\" style=\"width:220px\">\n  <button class=\"xxd-picker__trigger\"><span class=\"xxd-picker__value\"></span></button>\n  <div class=\"xxd-listbox\">\n    <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"poster\" aria-selected=\"true\">海报</div>\n    <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"cover\">封面</div>\n    <div class=\"xxd-option\" data-value=\"card\">卡片</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
      "js": "picker.addEventListener(\"xxd:change\", (e) => e.detail.value)  // 多选时是数组；picker.dataset.value 逗号分隔",
      "react": "Select",
      "a11y": [
        "按钮 aria-haspopup=listbox，列表 aria-activedescendant 跟随高亮",
        "↑ ↓ Home End 移动，Enter / 空格选择，Esc 关，输入首字跳转"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Search",
      "zh": "搜索框",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-input-wrap",
        "xxd-input-clear"
      ],
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-input-wrap\">\n  <i data-xxd-icon=\"Search\" data-size=\"16\"></i>\n  <input class=\"xxd-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索设置（⌘F）\">\n  <button class=\"xxd-input-clear\" aria-label=\"清空\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"X\" data-size=\"14\"></i></button>\n</div>",
      "js": "Xxd.bindSearch(input, { onQuery: (q) => Xxd.markMatches(container, q) })",
      "rules": [
        "⌘F / Ctrl+F 跳到它，Esc 清空",
        "匹配的字用 mark.xxd-hit 标出来"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "InputGroup",
      "zh": "输入组",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-input-group",
        "xxd-input-group__addon",
        "xxd-input-group__suffix"
      ],
      "summary": "前后缀、内嵌按钮。整组是一个框，聚焦时整组边框变深一次。",
      "attributes": {
        "data-size": "sm",
        "aria-invalid": "出错"
      },
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-input-group\" style=\"width:320px\">\n  <span class=\"xxd-input-group__addon\">https://</span>\n  <input aria-label=\"子域名\" value=\"today\">\n  <span class=\"xxd-input-group__suffix\">.xiaoxiaodong.ai</span>\n  <button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\">检查</button>\n</div>",
      "react": "InputGroup",
      "rules": [
        "一个框只有一个框：前后缀在框里面，不是两个框拼起来"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SecretInput",
      "zh": "密钥输入",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-secret"
      ],
      "summary": "API 密钥、令牌：默认遮住，可以显示 / 隐藏、一键复制。会员站的 API 设置和插件的 AI 服务密钥都用它。",
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-field\" style=\"width:340px\">\n  <label class=\"xxd-label\" for=\"k1\">API 密钥</label>\n  <div class=\"xxd-input-group xxd-secret\" data-xxd-secret>\n    <input id=\"k1\" type=\"password\" value=\"sk_live_4f8a2c91d7e3b6a0\" readonly>\n    <button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-icon-only data-size=\"sm\" data-secret-toggle aria-label=\"显示\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Eye\" data-size=\"16\"></i></button>\n    <button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-icon-only data-size=\"sm\" data-secret-copy aria-label=\"复制\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Copy\" data-size=\"16\"></i></button>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"xxd-help\">只保存在这台电脑上。</p>\n</div>",
      "react": "SensitiveInput",
      "a11y": [
        "显示 / 隐藏按钮是切换按钮（aria-pressed），文字跟着变",
        "复制成功的「已复制」通过 live region 读出"
      ],
      "rules": [
        "默认遮住；显示后不要自动再遮住（用户自己决定）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ClipboardText",
      "zh": "可复制的值",
      "category": "表单",
      "classes": [
        "xxd-clipboard"
      ],
      "summary": "只读的值加一个复制按钮；复制后按钮上方冒出「已复制」，图标变勾一下。",
      "attributes": {
        "data-size": "sm"
      },
      "markup": "<div class=\"xxd-clipboard\" style=\"width:300px\">\n  <code>pnpm xxd new ~/js/插件-今日待办</code>\n  <button class=\"xxd-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-icon-only data-size=\"sm\" aria-label=\"复制\" data-copy=\"pnpm xxd new ~/js/插件-今日待办\"><i data-xxd-icon=\"Copy\" data-size=\"14\"></i></button>\n</div>",
      "react": "ClipboardText",
      "js": "[data-copy=\"文本\"] 或 [data-copy-target=\"#选择器\"]；data-copy-done 自定义气泡文字"
    },
    {
      "name": "InlineCopy",
      "zh": "正文里可复制的字",
